## Part 2: Privacy Policy

### 1. Introduction
Welcome to Cyber Save. Your privacy is our priority. This app is designed as a **standalone utility**, meaning we do not use external servers to process or store your personal media files. 

### 2. Data Collection (The "Standalone" Difference)
*   **User Media:** This Application processes videos, images, and documents locally on your device. We do not upload, store, or have access to any files you process or download.
*   **No Account Required:** You can use Cyber Save without creating an account or providing an email address.

### 3. Third-Party Services & Advertising
To keep this app free, we use **Appodeal** for ad mediation (integrating AdMob, AppLovin, Unity, and others). These third parties may automatically collect:
