### 5. User Rights (GDPR/CCPA)
*   **Opt-out:** You can reset your Advertising ID or opt-out of ad personalization in your Android System Settings.
*   **Consent Management:** Upon the first launch, a consent window is provided (via Appodeal) to allow users in regulated regions to manage their data preferences.

